uint8_t 
u8  

uint16_t 
u16  

uint32_t 
u32  

uint64_t 
u64  

int8_t 
i8  

int16_t 
i16  

int32_t 
i32  

int64_t 
i64       
Floating-point types   
Rust requires IEEE-754 semantics. In C, that is typically true, but not guaranteed by the standard.        
